School of Fine Art deploys an Azure OpenAI chat model by using Bicep. The deployment must meet the following requirements:

- Use pay-per-token billing for a long-running production workload, with processing allowed in any Azure region.
- Run the model version that the team validated, which the template receives in the validatedVersion parameter.
- Upgrade automatically only when that version reaches its retirement date.

How should you complete the Bicep code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

```bicep
resource chat 'Microsoft.CognitiveServices/accounts/deployments@2024-10-01' = {
  parent: account
  name: 'chat-prod'
  sku: {
    name: '[[1]]'
    capacity: 100
  }
  properties: {
    model: {
      format: 'OpenAI'
      name: modelName
      version: [[2]]
    }
    versionUpgradeOption: '[[3]]'
  }
}
```
